            <![CDATA[
                <p><strong>Today while astral projecting I summoned allah to try and weaken him so our hexing spells would work better.<br><br>He is so fucking powerful. I'm not at a power level to do this alone. I barely escaped with my life and I'm spiritually injured to a great amount, but I think I'll make it.<br><br>I can't imagine what he would do to a new, unsuspecting witch. I'm scared that I will have to face him again soon if I ever want to continue astral projecting. I'm currently burning healing incense and drawing spiritual energy from my crystals to try and heal as quickly as possible.<br><br>Please be safe everyone. Allah is much stronger than I first imagined and we will have to do this together if we want to slay a god.</strong></p>
